      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, this is a solid start and actually quite readable. \n\nHowever, I just checked the dashboard for the triage tool and the score for this summary was super low. It looks like the system is flagging this as \"low density\" because there aren't enough discrete items identified. \n\nCan you expand this list? I know I said not to go overboard, but we really need a higher score to get this pushed through the automated queue for the engineers to see it. If you can break down the more complex items into their logical components or sub-tasks, it might help the score and actually help the devs know exactly where to start. Just try to keep it somewhat professional.",
